    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2018160575981719865",
      "url": "https://x.com/bitcoinprophet1/status/2018160575981719865",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/bitcoinprophet1/status/2018160575981719865",
      "text": "Crypto VC Funding is USELESS and DEAD🧟‍♂️, and how it ties in to Constellation Network $DAG 👇\n\nand you will want to read this entire thing.\n\nVC funding in crypto is the same as QE in trad markets:\n\nprice pumps only because of artificial demand and hype, not because of adoption or network growth. \n\nwe've seen hundreds of networks come and go because they took in tens of millions, heck, BILLIONS of funding from VCs. Price went up, everyone farted, then sold out. What's interesting though is how fast the VC money was burned by these crypto projects, and very little cutting edge tech was born from the VC coffers. \n\n@Conste11ation is head and shoulders above all other networks, because they didn't take a penny in funding from any VC or short-term P&D investors. \n\nConstellation recently announced their acquisition in a roll-up to go LIVE on Nasdaq (subject to SEC approval) by a strategic Dallas-based family office, whose founder, John Rochon, achieved a historic 92% CAGR and created $50B in shareholder value, over a multi-decade year career, spanning brick and mortar retail, CPG and more. This isn't just a roll-up like we see in PE: this legend is creating the Berkshire Hathaway of AI, to use @Dagnum_PI 's accurate description. \n\nThe entire team, led by CEO @BenJorgensen, will stay on and continue their stellar work, but this time, they will be supported by an additional $25mm in funding from Rochon to grow the Hypergraph. \n\nI'd argue that Constellation achieved more, and became more integral to governments and enterprises, because it was not beholden to any short-term thinking VCs, compared to blockchain projects that took in outside VC funding, to the tune of multi-millions. \n\n@Conste11ation became the US Government's TRUSTED DLT network for data integrity, data assurance, cybersecurity, and more, with zero VC funding.\n\n@Conste11ation partnered with @panasonic. with zero VC funding.\n\n@Conste11ation is bringing brick and mortar data to life across thousands of locations, with zero in VC funding, after they acquired an IOT device company, @DorTechnologies in 2021, whose Dor Traffic Miners are live across thousands of brick and mortar locations across multiple continents. \n\n@Conste11ation has transformed the real estate industry with @RELedger_io, providing honest and transparent data to homeowners and RE management companies, with zero in VC funding. \n\n@Conste11ation 's co-founders spent countless hours with members of the US Congress, providing invaluable insight into data integrity and trusted AI. Members of Congress couldn't care less about Constellation's lack of VC funding. \n\n@Conste11ation is actively building Philippines' national lottery on the Hypergraph, no VC funding necessary for this partnership.\n\n@Conste11ation is used by @CommonCrawl which is in turn used by the world's largest LLMs. No VC funding was necessary to achieve this relationship. \n\nIn a sea of noise and hype, Constellation Network truly is in a league of its own.\n\nMy question and point is, now that Constellation will have $25mm in its treasury, imagine what they CAN achieve with a substantial amount of firepower, when they've already achieved the nearly impossible, with no funding? \n\n$DAG is the KING 👑",
